  "question": {
    "text": "In the following reaction, the final product can be prepared by two paths <math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>)</mo></math> and <math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>)</mo></math> .<br />\rWhich of the following statements is correct?<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/660556_1.PNG\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 450px; height: 249px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
